                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبَّهَهُ عَلَى الشَّىْءِ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>He made him acquainted
with the thing; informed him of it; gave him
notice of it; notified it to him.</i> (S.) ― 
